+    """The library's get_scheduler_metadata for cache_seqlens cs, called with what mha_fwd derives for kernel_fn's FA3
+    call on this row: num_heads 16, num_heads_k / headdim of the actual view (paired 1 / 128, else 2 / 64),
+    max_seqlen_q 8 with cu_seqlens_q, max_seqlen_k = page-table width x page size 1, causal, window (-1, -1), e4m3,
+    num_splits 0. Import-time only."""
